[I] HTTP::Date - date conversion routines

[T] HTTP::Date is a Perl module providing functions to convert between
[T] machine time and the date formats used in HTTP and other protocols. It
[T] formats times as GMT strings and parses a wide range of date formats
[T] into Unix time.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/HTTP-Date

